{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-16-1","title":"Luke 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The parable of the unjust steward. 14 Christ reproves the hypocrisy of the covetous Pharisees. 19 The parable of the rich man and Lazarus the beggar.</p>\n<p>a certain. Mt 18:23,24; 25:14-30 a steward. 8:3; 12:42; Ge 15:2; 43:19; 1Ch 28:1; 1Co 4:1,2; Tit 1:7; 1Pe 4:10 wasted. 19; 15:13,30; 19:20; Pr 18:9; Ho 2:8; Jas 4:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-2","title":"Luke 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>How. Ge 3:9-11; 4:9,10; 18:20,21; 1Sa 2:23,24; 1Co 1:11; 1Ti 5:24 give. 12:42; Ec 11:9,10; 12:14; Mt 12:36; Ro 14:12; 1Co 4:2,5; 2Co 5:10 1Pe 4:5,10; 1Ti 4:14; Re 20:12 for. 12:20; 19:21-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-3","title":"Luke 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>said. 18:4; Es 6:6 What. 12:17; Isa 10:3; Jer 5:31; Ho 9:5; Ac 9:6 I cannot. Pr 13:4; 15:19; 18:9; 19:15; 21:25,26; 24:30-34; 26:13-16; 27:23-27 Pr 29:21; 2Th 3:11 to beg. 20,22; Pr 20:4; Mr 10:46; Joh 9:8; Ac 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-4","title":"Luke 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Pr 30:9; Jer 4:22; Jas 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-5","title":"Luke 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>his. 7:41,42; Mt 18:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-6","title":"Luke 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>measures.\"The word Batos in the original containeth nine gallons, three quarts. See Eze 45:10-14.\"</p>\n<p>Take. 9,12; Tit 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-7","title":"Luke 16:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>An hundred. 20:9,12; So 8:11,12 measures.\"The word here interpreted a measure, in the original containeth about fourteen bushels and a pottle. Gr.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-8","title":"Luke 16:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>unjust. 10; 18:6 done. 4; Ge 3:1; Ex 1:10; 2Sa 13:3; 2Ki 10:19; Pr 6:6-8 children of this. 20:34; Ps 17:14; 1Co 3:18; Php 3:19 in. Ps 49:10-19; Mt 17:26 children of light. Joh 12:36; Eph 5:8; 1Th 5:5; 1Pe 2:9; 1Jo 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-9","title":"Luke 16:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Make. 11:41; 14:14; Pr 19:17; Ec 11:1; Isa 58:7,8; Da 4:27; Mt 6:19; 19:21 Mt 25:35-40; Ac 10:4,31; 2Co 9:12-15; 1Ti 6:17-19; 2Ti 1:16-18 of the. 11,13 mammon. or, riches. Pr 23:5; 1Ti 6:9,10,17 when. Ps 73:26; Ec 12:3-7; Isa 57:16 into. 2Co 4:17,18; 5:1; 1Ti 6:18; Jude 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-10","title":"Luke 16:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>faithful in. 11,12; 19:17; Mt 25:21; Heb 3:2 he that is unjust. Joh 12:6; 13:2,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-11","title":"Luke 16:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>in. 9 true. 12:33; 18:22; Pr 8:18,19; Eph 3:8; Jas 2:5; Re 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-12","title":"Luke 16:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>in. 19:13-26; 1Ch 29:14-16; Job 1:21; Eze 16:16-21; Ho 2:8; Mt 25:14-29 that which is your. 10:42; Col 3:3,4; 1Pe 1:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-13","title":"Luke 16:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>servant. 9:50; 11:23; Jos 24:15; Mt 4:10; 6:24; Ro 6:16-22; 8:5-8; Jas 4:4 1Jo 2:15,16 hate. 14:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-14","title":"Luke 16:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>who. 12:15; 20:47; Isa 56:11; Jer 6:13; 8:10; Eze 22:25-29; 33:31 Mt 23:14 derided. 8:53; 23:35; Ps 35:15,16; 119:51; Isa 53:3; Jer 20:7,8; Heb 11:36 Heb 12:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-15","title":"Luke 16:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Ye. 10:29; 11:39; 18:11,21; 20:20,47; Pr 20:6; Mt 6:2,5,16; 23:5,25-27 Ro 3:20; Jas 2:21-25 God. 1Sa 16:7; 1Ch 29:17; 2Ch 6:30; Ps 7:9; 139:1,2; Jer 17:10; Joh 2:25 Joh 21:17; Ac 1:18; 15:8; 1Co 4:5; Re 2:23 for. Ps 10:3; 49:13,18; Pr 16:5; Isa 1:10-14; Am 5:21,22; Mal 3:15 1Pe 3:4; 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-16","title":"Luke 16:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Law. 29,31; Mt 11:9-14; Joh 1:45; Ac 3:18,24,25 the kingdom. 9:2; 10:9,11; Mt 3:2; 4:17; 10:7; Mr 1:14 and every. 7:26-29; Mt 21:32; Mr 1:45; Joh 11:48; 12:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-17","title":"Luke 16:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>it. 21:33; Ps 102:25-27; Isa 51:6; Mt 5:18; 2Pe 3:10; Re 20:11; 21:1,4 than. Isa 40:8; Ro 3:31; 1Pe 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-18","title":"Luke 16:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Mt 5:32; 19:9; Mr 10:11,12; 1Co 7:4,10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-19","title":"Luke 16:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>river. 12:16-21; 18:24,25; Jas 5:1-5 clothed. 1; 15:13; Job 21:11-15; Ps 73:3-7; Eze 16:49; Am 6:4-6; Re 17:4 Re 18:7,16 purple. Jud 8:26; Es 8:15; Eze 16:13; 27:7; Mr 15:17,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-20","title":"Luke 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>a certain. 18:35-43; 1Sa 2:8; Jas 1:9; 2:5 Lazarus. Joh 11:1 was laid. Ac 3:2 full. 21; Job 2:7; Ps 34:19; 73:14; Isa 1:6; Jer 8:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-21","title":"Luke 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>desiring. 1Co 4:11; 2Co 11:27 crumbs. Mt 15:27; Mr 7:28; Joh 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-22","title":"Luke 16:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>that. Job 3:13-19; Isa 57:1,2; Re 14:13 was carried. Ps 91:11,12; Mt 13:38-43; 24:31; Heb 2:14 Abraham's. Mt 8:11; Joh 13:23; 21:20 the river. 12:20; Job 21:13,30-32; Ps 49:6-12,16-19; 73:18-20; Pr 14:32 Mr 8:36; Jas 1:11; 1Pe 2:24 and was buried. 2Ki 9:34,35; Ec 8:10; Isa 14:18; 22:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-23","title":"Luke 16:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>in hell. Ps 9:17; 16:10; 49:15; 86:13; Pr 5:5; 7:27; 9:18; 15:24; Isa 14:9,15 Mt 5:22,29; 18:9; 23:33; 1Co 15:55; *marg: 2Pe 2:4; Re 20:13,14 being. 28; 8:28; Mt 8:29; Re 14:10,11; 20:10 seeth. 13:28,29; Mt 8:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-24","title":"Luke 16:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Father. 30; 3:8; Mt 3:9; Joh 8:33-39,53-56; Ro 4:12; 9:7,8 have. 1Sa 28:16; Isa 27:11; Jas 2:13 in water. Isa 41:17,18; 65:13,14; Joh 4:10,14; 7:37; Re 7:16,17; 22:1 and cool. Zec 14:12; Jas 3:6 for. Isa 66:24; Mt 25:41; Mr 9:43-49; 2Th 1:8; Re 14:10,11; 19:20; 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-25","title":"Luke 16:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Son. 24 remember. 23; La 1:7; Da 5:22,23,30; Mr 9:46 thy good. 6:24; Job 21:13,14; 22:18; Ps 17:14; 37:35,36; 49:11; 73:7,12-19 Ro 8:7; Php 3:19; 1Jo 2:15 likewise. 20; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22; 1Th 3:3; Heb 11:25; Re 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-26","title":"Luke 16:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>between. 1Sa 25:36; Ps 49:14; Eze 28:24; Mal 3:18; 2Th 1:4-10; Jas 1:11,12 Jas 5:1-7 they pass. 12:59; Ps 50:22; Mt 25:46; Joh 3:36; 2Th 1:9; Re 20:10; 22:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-28","title":"Luke 16:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>lest. Ps 49:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-29","title":"Luke 16:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>have. 16; Isa 8:20; 34:16; Mal 4:2-4; Joh 5:39-45; Ac 15:21; 17:11,12 2Ti 3:15-17; 2Pe 1:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-30","title":"Luke 16:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>repent. 13:3,5; Re 16:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-16-31","title":"Luke 16:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>neither. Joh 11:43-53; 12:10,11; 2Co 4:3 be persuaded. Ge 9:27; *marg: Ac 19:8; 26:28; 28:23; 2Co 5:11</p>"}]}